1
00:00:02,460 --> 00:00:05,100
=The Truth (Season 4)=
(New bonus scenes)

2
00:00:05,140 --> 00:00:07,420
(The Listening Comprehension Test)

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,270
It's just those two organizations.

4
00:00:09,280 --> 00:00:10,340
Actually, three organizations now.

5
00:00:10,340 --> 00:00:11,700
One is Thousand-Faced Eagle King.

6
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:12,680
One is The Touch Today Group,

7
00:00:12,680 --> 00:00:13,680
and that's useless.

8
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:14,960
Why is he the boss?

9
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:17,250
With two idiot underlings.

10
00:00:17,280 --> 00:00:19,150
What if they're my underlings?

11
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:20,790
(Ke being blunt)
Your organization is the weakest.

12
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:22,820
There are only three of you.

13
00:00:22,820 --> 00:00:24,890
Those two underlings have already

14
00:00:25,560 --> 00:00:26,830
been taken out.

15
00:00:26,840 --> 00:00:28,450
Yeah, he might be.

16
00:00:28,450 --> 00:00:29,280
Who is he?

17
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:31,340
He should be
from the Thousand-Faced Eagle King.

18
00:00:31,340 --> 00:00:32,320
With you guys.

19
00:00:32,330 --> 00:00:33,050
You're from Kuang Kingdom.

20
00:00:33,050 --> 00:00:33,790
You know that, right?

21
00:00:33,790 --> 00:00:34,950
He has three underlings in total.

22
00:00:34,950 --> 00:00:37,140
One of them
is with Thousand-Faced Eagle King.

23
00:00:37,140 --> 00:00:38,810
And one boss is still here.

24
00:00:39,260 --> 00:00:39,630
Okay.

25
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:41,990
(He's an ally)
So he's here to help us.

26
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:42,800
Your status now

27
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:44,240
(Ning starts roasting)
is the lowest in our group.

28
00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:44,750
I'm telling you.

29
00:00:45,580 --> 00:00:46,380
(That hit a nerve)

30
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:47,540
Mad Dragon.

31
00:00:47,540 --> 00:00:48,180
(Scared me)

32
00:00:49,320 --> 00:00:52,590
Proudblood, Ruthless Duke, Mad Dragon.

33
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:53,390
What?

34
00:00:55,280 --> 00:00:56,130
What are you saying?

35
00:00:56,130 --> 00:00:57,170
(He doesn't get it)
Speak a little louder.

36
00:00:57,170 --> 00:00:57,500
No.

37
00:00:57,520 --> 00:00:58,300
There's no volume control.

38
00:00:58,300 --> 00:00:59,180
(Waiting)

39
00:00:59,720 --> 00:01:02,470
Proudblood, Ruthless Duke, Mad Dragon.

40
00:01:02,480 --> 00:01:03,790
Please respond.

41
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:05,020
What move toward?

42
00:01:05,020 --> 00:01:05,900
(Can't make out the words)

43
00:01:07,080 --> 00:01:08,830
Please respond.

44
00:01:08,840 --> 00:01:10,390
(Jin's conclusion)
It's like those English listening tests.

45
00:01:10,460 --> 00:01:11,380
(I totally get it)

46
00:01:11,420 --> 00:01:13,700
(Auction warm-up)

47
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:15,290
The auction is about to start.

48
00:01:15,290 --> 00:01:18,330
Does this look familiar to you?

49
00:01:18,360 --> 00:01:19,910
The king's emblem

50
00:01:19,920 --> 00:01:24,190
(Listen to Yang)
from the Kuang, Tui, and Li Kingdoms.

51
00:01:25,240 --> 00:01:26,670
Everyone, please take your seats.

52
00:01:26,670 --> 00:01:28,310
Our auction is about to begin.

53
00:01:28,320 --> 00:01:31,910
We'll hand out your bidding numbers.

54
00:01:32,340 --> 00:01:33,140
(Watching closely)

55
00:01:33,400 --> 00:01:36,830
(Jin doesn't get it)
Why are you keep looking at me?

56
00:01:36,840 --> 00:01:38,560
(Don't break character)
That's my character. Don't ruin it.

57
00:01:38,560 --> 00:01:40,150
Your character is supposed
to stare at him

58
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:40,950
or stare at me?

59
00:01:40,960 --> 00:01:42,110
(All in)
To stare at everyone.

60
00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:44,190
(Staring)
I didn't recognize you in this look.

61
00:01:44,700 --> 00:01:45,540
(Shy)

62
00:01:46,440 --> 00:01:47,430
(Sweetly saying the most ruthless thing)
Full bid.

63
00:01:48,460 --> 00:01:49,620
(We found a pro)

64
00:01:49,800 --> 00:01:51,430
You even know what "full bid" means?

65
00:01:52,960 --> 00:01:54,190
You ancient woman.

66
00:01:54,190 --> 00:01:56,090
(Suspicious)
Are you really saying "full bid"?

67
00:01:57,220 --> 00:01:58,420
(Almost broke character)

68
00:01:58,460 --> 00:02:00,740
(Starts swinging the sword
around after getting it)

69
00:02:02,260 --> 00:02:03,820
(Nice stuff)

70
00:02:04,420 --> 00:02:05,180
(Let me play with it)

71
00:02:06,780 --> 00:02:08,380
(Interesting)

72
00:02:10,380 --> 00:02:11,980
(Playing with the sword)

73
00:02:13,340 --> 00:02:14,940
(Just warming up)

74
00:02:17,820 --> 00:02:23,740
(Sword showtime. He takes the stage)

75
00:02:25,300 --> 00:02:26,980
(Playing along)

76
00:02:27,520 --> 00:02:29,020
Thousand-Faced Eagle King
only has you three.

77
00:02:29,920 --> 00:02:30,670
You too.

78
00:02:30,680 --> 00:02:32,860
(Puts away sword)
I'm not with you.

79
00:02:34,160 --> 00:02:35,150
(Sword)
What's the mission?

80
00:02:35,160 --> 00:02:37,430
On the day of the auction,

81
00:02:37,440 --> 00:02:38,950
(Seriously listening to Ning)
we need to get

82
00:02:40,480 --> 00:02:42,110
(Reasoning and swordplay)
those three treasures.

83
00:02:42,460 --> 00:02:43,180
(Little skit begins)

84
00:02:43,180 --> 00:02:44,580
(Ready, Ding?)

85
00:02:44,580 --> 00:02:45,700
(Bring it, He)

86
00:02:47,620 --> 00:02:48,980
(Playing along)

87
00:02:49,420 --> 00:02:50,500
(Ding goes dark)

88
00:02:50,940 --> 00:02:52,300
(I'm fighting back)

89
00:02:54,020 --> 00:02:55,700
(Here comes the chance)

90
00:02:56,980 --> 00:02:58,540
(Sneak attack)

91
00:03:01,760 --> 00:03:03,030
The killer's gone crazy.

92
00:03:03,980 --> 00:03:05,700
(Sword back with Ke)

93
00:03:06,500 --> 00:03:08,300
(Strike a pose)

94
00:03:11,460 --> 00:03:13,180
(Smooth as silk)

95
00:03:23,420 --> 00:03:25,700
(The familiar ID is back)

96
00:03:25,720 --> 00:03:27,070
Wait. I have a question.

97
00:03:27,080 --> 00:03:29,270
Only the two of us
are members of this organization.

98
00:03:29,280 --> 00:03:32,510
So we've narrowed it down
to two people now.

99
00:03:32,880 --> 00:03:34,270
He's not one of them?

100
00:03:34,270 --> 00:03:35,480
(I'm not, I'm not)
I'm not.

101
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:37,060
But he could pretend to be

102
00:03:37,060 --> 00:03:38,180
someone from Thousand-Faced Eagle King.

103
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:39,670
(Taking it seriously)
He could tell him he's from the group.

104
00:03:39,680 --> 00:03:41,190
Look at our group members.

105
00:03:41,200 --> 00:03:43,350
Yeah, because that person
is from the group.

106
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:44,630
He sent me the message.

107
00:03:44,640 --> 00:03:46,110
Exactly.

108
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:47,900
So twenty people in your group

109
00:03:47,900 --> 00:03:49,770
(Key point)
share the same information.

110
00:03:49,800 --> 00:03:51,150
I'm not even in the organization.

111
00:03:51,160 --> 00:03:52,670
(Desperately proving his innocence)
How could I have messaged her?

112
00:03:53,320 --> 00:03:54,150
(Sees through everything)

113
00:03:54,160 --> 00:03:56,270
There is Proudblood,
Ruthless Duke, Mad Dragon.

114
00:03:56,440 --> 00:03:58,030
Am I really in the group?

115
00:03:58,030 --> 00:03:58,640
I am

116
00:03:59,110 --> 00:04:03,040
Thunder, the Supreme Phantom Dragonlord.

117
00:04:03,360 --> 00:04:06,510
(Dragonlord becomes a potato)
You must be Potato.

118
00:04:06,520 --> 00:04:07,310
Sorry.

119
00:04:07,320 --> 00:04:08,870
(Potato herself)
I just really like potatoes.

120
00:04:13,120 --> 00:04:14,070
Which one are you?

121
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:15,550
I'm Mad Dragon.

122
00:04:15,550 --> 00:04:16,780
My name

123
00:04:17,290 --> 00:04:20,860
is Proudblood,
Ruthless Duke, Mad Dragon.

124
00:04:21,360 --> 00:04:22,560
(Officially lost her memory)
I've forgotten who I am.

125
00:04:22,560 --> 00:04:23,640
(Blueberry lover)
Do we have blueberries?

126
00:04:23,640 --> 00:04:24,830
You're princess.

127
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:28,350
You're Princess Donasia
Ronaswa Ulala, right?

128
00:04:28,350 --> 00:04:29,120
I am

129
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:33,290
Princess Donasia Ronaswa Ulala.

130
00:04:33,320 --> 00:04:33,950
Who am I?

131
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:36,350
Proudblood Mad Dragon.

132
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:37,680
(You got it wrong)
I'm Mad Dragon.

133
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:39,030
You must be Sweet Potato.

134
00:04:39,030 --> 00:04:40,450
I'm not Sweet Potato.

135
00:04:40,450 --> 00:04:41,120
Genius Boy.

136
00:04:41,120 --> 00:04:42,160
He's Genius Boy.

137
00:04:43,890 --> 00:04:45,870
Lanalan Lunalan Genius Boy.

138
00:04:45,880 --> 00:04:47,670
You're princess.

139
00:04:47,680 --> 00:04:49,320
(Everyone remembers now)
Princess is Sun Qian.

140
00:04:49,340 --> 00:04:50,160
Helpful Contact.

141
00:04:50,490 --> 00:04:51,470
Who's Helpful Contact?

142
00:04:51,480 --> 00:04:53,120
He's been undercover this whole time.

143
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:53,920
I think that's right.

144
00:04:53,960 --> 00:04:54,590
Because the two of us have

145
00:04:54,600 --> 00:04:56,030
our own IDs (identities).

146
00:04:56,040 --> 00:05:00,470
Except the one pretending
to stay undercover.

147
00:05:00,980 --> 00:05:01,980
(Look me in the eyes)

148
00:05:02,580 --> 00:05:03,460
(Pressing closer)

149
00:05:04,840 --> 00:05:06,450
Isn't this you?

150
00:05:06,450 --> 00:05:08,310
Wait, Leggy McShy,

151
00:05:08,310 --> 00:05:11,380
(Finally caught you)
Kinda Awkward, Innocent Hunk.

152
00:05:11,380 --> 00:05:12,420
Isn't this you?

153
00:05:12,420 --> 00:05:13,290
(Still denying it)
Isn't this you?

154
00:05:13,290 --> 00:05:14,330
I am

155
00:05:14,330 --> 00:05:15,740
Leggy McShy,

156
00:05:15,740 --> 00:05:19,210
Kinda Awkward, Innocent Hunk.

157
00:05:19,680 --> 00:05:21,830
(One more jab)
You were quick to clear yourself.

158
00:05:23,480 --> 00:05:25,790
(Caught red-handed)
You were just trying to deny it.

159
00:05:26,040 --> 00:05:27,300
I don't know!

160
00:05:27,590 --> 00:05:28,580
I don't know.

161
00:05:28,580 --> 00:05:29,670
(Number one troublemaker)
I don't know.

162
00:05:29,680 --> 00:05:30,590
Are you a little rabbit?

163
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:31,990
You don't know anything.

164
00:05:34,020 --> 00:05:36,300
(The ice cream they can't forget)

165
00:05:37,840 --> 00:05:38,840
There's ice cream in the back.

166
00:05:38,840 --> 00:05:39,790
(Foodie is on the hunt)
I'll see if I can get some.

167
00:05:39,790 --> 00:05:40,240
Okay.

168
00:05:42,700 --> 00:05:44,060
(On the hunt for food)

169
00:05:45,680 --> 00:05:48,310
Zhang Jiawei is looking for food again.

170
00:05:48,320 --> 00:05:48,880
He's just that hungry.

171
00:05:48,880 --> 00:05:50,550
He told me, "Hold the mic for me."

172
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:52,230
"I'll see if I can get some ice cream."

173
00:05:52,300 --> 00:05:53,460
(Exact replica)

174
00:05:55,910 --> 00:05:57,060
Zhang Jiawei.

175
00:05:57,380 --> 00:05:58,640
I can't open it.

176
00:05:58,640 --> 00:05:59,720
(Came up empty-handed)
The fridge is locked

177
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:01,670
(I thought you were just kidding)
You really are looking for food?

178
00:06:01,680 --> 00:06:03,550
Yeah, there's a fridge back here.
It's full of ice cream.

179
00:06:03,600 --> 00:06:05,150
What's this key for?

180
00:06:05,160 --> 00:06:06,810
Is there anything here it can open?

181
00:06:07,170 --> 00:06:08,060
Well, Curator Tui.

182
00:06:08,060 --> 00:06:08,930
There's a fridge in the back.

183
00:06:08,930 --> 00:06:10,180
(Been thinking about it nonstop)
It's full of ice cream.

184
00:06:10,180 --> 00:06:11,750
(Foodie joins the hunt)
Let's find some ice cream.

185
00:06:11,960 --> 00:06:13,360
(Foodie +1) I want some too.

186
00:06:13,380 --> 00:06:14,140
I can't open it.

187
00:06:14,140 --> 00:06:15,150
(Feeling wronged)
It's locked.

188
00:06:15,150 --> 00:06:16,160
What's locked?

189
00:06:18,440 --> 00:06:19,610
(Be honest)
There's a fridge in the back.

190
00:06:20,260 --> 00:06:21,060
(Let me look)

191
00:06:21,480 --> 00:06:22,590
What are you doing?

192
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:24,220
(I know)
She's going to look for food.

193
00:06:25,460 --> 00:06:26,340
(Came up empty-handed +1)

194
00:06:26,560 --> 00:06:28,190
Let's go, everyone.

195
00:06:28,200 --> 00:06:29,430
Well, you can get some sleep.

196
00:06:29,440 --> 00:06:29,980
Pull the blanket over you.

197
00:06:29,980 --> 00:06:31,160
Rest for a bit before you go.

198
00:06:31,160 --> 00:06:32,170
Get some sleep.

199
00:06:32,200 --> 00:06:33,230
(Always on my mind)
There's ice cream over there.

200
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:34,310
You can have some.

201
00:06:34,320 --> 00:06:35,790
(Can't forget it)
You can grab some for us too.

202
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:37,270
(Still thinking about it)
Grab some for us.

203
00:06:37,280 --> 00:06:38,020
Let's go.

204
00:06:38,020 --> 00:06:38,980
Longdong Army.

205
00:06:38,980 --> 00:06:44,090
Longdong Army!

206
00:06:44,120 --> 00:06:46,580
It kind of sounds
like "Crayon Shin-chan".

207
00:06:49,020 --> 00:06:50,100
=The Truth (Season 4)=

208
00:06:50,110 --> 00:06:51,320
(SVIP updates Wed & Thu at 12PM.)

209
00:06:51,340 --> 00:06:52,260
(VIP updates next day at 12PM,
one week early.)
